# Response headers for learn.shahmohammadi.dev. Same rules as the main site's
# public/_headers: every matching block applies and same-named headers are
# joined with a comma, so `/*` carries security headers only and never a
# Cache-Control. The page is one HTML file with no fixed-path assets to cache
# for a year, so nothing here needs `immutable`.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy, for the same reason as the main site: the page is
# one inline module script by design (the brief asked for a single
# self-contained index.html), so a useful policy needs a hash of that script
# generated at deploy time. Worth doing, in its own change.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
